  "notes": "Category is a template-mapping choice: KUMO is an interactive multi-turn reasoning benchmark, mapped to Agentic/Interactive. Paper/site describe 5,000 tasks across 100 domains; the public Hugging Face collection exposes kumo-easy and kumo-hard viewers with 250 rows each. Includes all 23 models from the official HF leaderboard snapshots easy_0402.json and hard_0402.json. Each entry also carries a derived weighted_success_rate_harbor_subset = (202*easy_success_rate + 10*hard_success_rate)/212, matching the Harbor matrix split of 202 KUMO(easy, t4-a6) + 10 KUMO(hard, t12-a16) tasks (per harbor/adapters/kumo/README.md). This ratio matches the paper pin (5050:250). The adapter README recommends reporting easy/hard separately; the weighted field is added for cross-benchmark Harbor-vs-external comparison only."
}
